WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/features/analytics/pages/PeriodComparePage.tsx (route /period-compare). PageContainer with
  title/subtitle + four data states. Data: useVehicles (GET /vehicles) + two inline
  /analytics/period-stats?vehicle_id&days queries (Period A + Period B). Regions:
    • Disambiguation AlertBanner → /vehicle-comparison (hidden for <2 vehicles + once dismissed).
    • GlassPanel selectors: Vehicle / Period A / Period B (PERIOD_VALUES 7/30/90/365/0).
    • MetricCard grid (6): Total Distance, Total Drives, Energy Used, Avg Efficiency, Total Cost,
      CO₂ Saved — each value+unit, "Period B: …" subtitle, signed % change pill, coloured icon.
    • GlassPanel BarChart: side-by-side A vs B per metric.
    • GlassPanel DataTable: Metric / Period A / Period B / Change(↑↓) / % Change(Badge).
    • GlassPanel Insights: 3 templated sentences (distance more/less, efficiency improved/declined,
      cost higher/lower).
  Helpers reproduced verbatim (arithmetic is the contract):
    pctChange(a,b) = b===0 ? {'—',positive:true} : {sign+fmtNumber(((a-b)/b)*100,1)+'%', pct>=0};
    distance: convertDistanceFromSI(total_distance*1000, unit)  (km=/1000, mi=/1609.344 exact);
    efficiency: unit==='mi' ? avg_efficiency*1.609344 : avg_efficiency (Wh/km→Wh/mi);
    fmtNumber = safeNumber(v).toLocaleString(locale, min=max=precision) (default precision 2).
  i18n: 34 compare.* keys (ported verbatim as the values).

