DATA-SOURCE DISCLOSURE  (no silent drift)
  The web page reads /analytics/period-stats. That route is NOT exposed by the KMP AnalyticsRepository
  (verified: apps/shared/core/.../AnalyticsRepository.kt has analyticsSummary/fleetAnalytics/mileage*/
  costBreakdown/timeline — no period-stats). Adding it is a backend/shared change, explicitly OUT OF
  SCOPE here. The page is therefore wired Shared-free through the PeriodCompareSource seam (exactly as
  all 300+ shipped feature-views are Shared-free). Previews + tests drive InMemoryPeriodCompareSource;
  the live registration injects UnavailablePeriodCompareSource, so the running app shows the page's REAL
  empty state — never fabricated "data". Integration swaps in a shared-core-backed source once the
  endpoint is exposed.

